"<userinput>make -C contrib/<replaceable>&lt;NOME-SUB-"
"DIRETÓRIO&gt;</replaceable> install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you only intend to use <application>PostgreSQL</application> as a client "
"to connect to a server on another machine, your installation is complete and"
" you should not run the remaining commands."
msgstr ""
"Se você pretende usar o &quot;<application>PostgreSQL</application>&quot; "
"somente como um cliente para conectar-se a um servidor em outra máquina, "
"[então] a tua instalação está completa e você não deveria executar os "
"comandos restantes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:269
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have upgraded an existing database, skip the rest of the commands "
"because your database is ready to use. If this is the first time you install"
" <application>PostgreSQL</application>, continue with the initialization."
msgstr ""
"Se você atualizou uma base de dados existente, [então] ignore o restante dos"
" comandos porque a tua base de dados está pronta para uso. Se essa for a "
"primeira vez que você instala o "
"&quot;<application>PostgreSQL</application>&quot;, [então] continue com a "
"inicialização."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Initialize a database cluster with the following commands issued by the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Inicialize um agrupamento de bases de dados com os seguintes comandos "
"emitidos pelo(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:280
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm700 /srv/pgsql/data &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755 /run/postgresql &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -Rv postgres:postgres /srv/pgsql /run/postgresql</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm700 /srv/pgsql/data &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755 /run/postgresql &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -Rv postgres:postgres /srv/pgsql /run/postgresql</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:285
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, initialize the database as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, inicialize a base de dados como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:289
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>su - postgres -c '/usr/bin/initdb -D /srv/pgsql/data'</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>su - postgres -c '/usr/bin/initdb -D /srv/pgsql/data'</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/databases/postgresql.xml:294
#, xml-text
